OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold start with frost
OL,6,Fin places and any fog patches quickly
OL,7,Fclearing. Remaining dry and settled
OL,8,Fduring the day with plenty of sunshine
OL,9,Fand light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry through the evening with
OL,12,Flengthy clear spells. It will stay dry
OL,13,Fovernight with some frost in places
OL,14,Fagain and areas of fog developing
OL,15,Fagain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
