OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FBright start with an early
OL,6,Ffrost, and any fog soon clearing.
OL,7,FTurning cloudy from late morning with
OL,8,Fsome patchy light rain possible, then
OL,9,Fbecoming drier and brighter again from
OL,10,Fmid-afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,13,Frather changeable few days, with
OL,14,Fspells of bright and dry weather
OL,15,Fbetween bands of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
